            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Health care coverage has changed dramatically over the past few decades, with more focus on integrated health systems, innovative treatments, and technology. These changes have resulted in cost savings and improved health for many. However, we continue to face challenges in improving outcomes for those with the greatest need.</AbstractText>
